Z||000015||88 Fiero||03-30-2000||11:44 AM||||Wisconsin...Those wheels are OZ's Competition Wheels...they are 17 X 7.5 with a 35mm offsets.. I have to shave the fronts down to about 42mm because they stick out...About the deck lid with the wing...I am really seriously considering selling it... But I need a buyer who is local so I dont have to worry about shipping. Also Wisconsin...I dont have those wheels anymore..sold for about $1,000.00 with tires on it... Although I got another set of wheels which is also 17's but the rears are 17 X 8.5 wide...||||reg||1
